    "Confirmation installs the listed dependencies together, using one installation allowance from each original license. Only private drafts are created; fact confirmation and the original review and publication process still apply. Reading the original result does not install again or use allowance.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Confirmation installs the listed dependencies together, using one installation allowance from each original license. Only private drafts are created; fact confirmation and the original review and publication process still apply. Reading the original result does not install again or use allowance."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认后将一并安装所列依赖，并占用每个原授权的一次安装额度。仅会创建私有草稿；事实确认以及原有的审核与发布流程仍然适用。读取原结果不会再次安装，也不会占用额度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Content is unconfirmed: reading may be unapproved, rights may have changed, the profile may not be native text, or the read may be unavailable. This does not mean the original installation failed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Content is unconfirmed: reading may be unapproved, rights may have changed, the profile may not be native text, or the read may be unavailable. This does not mean the original installation failed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内容尚未确认：可能未获批准读取、权益可能已变化、资料可能不是原生文本，或读取暂不可用。这并不表示原安装失败。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue original post-processing only, without recreating the activity or resending media with unknown outcomes.": {
