            "value": "分支以原 H5 服务器结果为准。关闭容器不视为放弃挑战。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original options or history exceeded the safe read capacity and are incomplete. No absence of pending requests is assumed and no new installation is enabled. Original requests and receipts are retained.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The original options or history exceeded the safe read capacity and are incomplete. No absence of pending requests is assumed and no new installation is enabled. Original requests and receipts are retained."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原选项或历史记录超出安全读取容量，内容不完整。不会假定不存在待处理请求，也不会开放新的安装。原请求和回执均会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original post-processing link is temporarily unavailable. The submitted activity facts remain intact.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The original post-processing link is temporarily unavailable. The submitted activity facts remain intact."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原后续处理链接暂时不可用。已提交的活动信息保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are current records, not available slots or confirmation of the original creation request. That request remains unconfirmed. Do not submit it again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
