          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the original request's server receipt, not permission to submit in the latest state below. Exhausted attempts do not mean a correct answer.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is the original request's server receipt, not permission to submit in the latest state below. Exhausted attempts do not mean a correct answer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是原请求的服务器回执，并不代表可以按下方最新状态提交。尝试次数用尽并不表示答案正确。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "UNDEFENDED WARNING": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UNDEFENDED WARNING"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未防护警告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "UNKNOWN 不是失败。离页、重启后仍核对同一请求；不换 ID、不重发，也不把当前选定或库存当作原请求成功。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UNKNOWN is not a failure. After leaving the page or restarting, the same request is still checked; the ID is not changed, nothing is resent, and the current selection or inventory is not treated as proof the original request succeeded."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UNKNOWN 不是失败。离页、重启后仍核对同一请求；不换 ID、不重发，也不把当前选定或库存当作原请求成功。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "UNKNOWN：仅按原 UUID 回读；当前消失/停用/原因相同不能证明本请求成功，不重发。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UNKNOWN: only re-read by the original UUID; the offer disappearing, being disabled or having an identical reason cannot prove this request succeeded, and it is not resent."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UNKNOWN：仅按原 UUID 回读；当前消失/停用/原因相同不能证明本请求成功，不重发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
