    "仅编辑原 TEAM survival.recoveries。休整使用填写的团队 HP 增加量；救助使用生命下限，仍由原上限、次数和回执结算。不会恢复本人资源、加 XP，或把配给消耗、购买和救援改成补给。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only edits the original TEAM survival.recoveries. Rest uses the entered team HP increase; rescue uses the life floor, still settled by the original cap, count and receipt. It does not restore your own resources, add XP, or turn ration use, purchases and rescues into supplies."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅编辑原 TEAM survival.recoveries。休整使用填写的团队 HP 增加量；救助使用生命下限，仍由原上限、次数和回执结算。不会恢复本人资源、加 XP，或把配给消耗、购买和救援改成补给。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅记录掷骰结果，不移动、不发奖。": {
