    "以上只表示原冻结合同范围，不授予原始资产转售/下载、未来所有大版本、额外安装额度或当前地点同意。缺省项不扩权；当前撤权及安全条件仍由原服务检查。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The above only describes the original frozen contract scope; it does not grant resale/download of original assets, all future major versions, extra install quota or current venue consent. Defaults never expand rights; current revocation and safety conditions are still checked by the original service."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以上只表示原冻结合同范围，不授予原始资产转售/下载、未来所有大版本、额外安装额度或当前地点同意。缺省项不扩权；当前撤权及安全条件仍由原服务检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以下为累计 XP 阈值，必须严格递增，条数等于等级上限减一；不会按输入等级自动猜测或倍增。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The following are cumulative XP thresholds; they must be strictly increasing, with a count equal to the level cap minus one. They are not guessed or multiplied from the entered level."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以下为累计 XP 阈值，必须严格递增，条数等于等级上限减一；不会按输入等级自动猜测或倍增。"
