    "没有自动 DC、加值或结果。checkId、启用开关及原 passive/team/opposed/empathy 专属字段保持原值；失败/兜底分支继续走原路线编辑与发布校验。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No automatic DC, bonus or result. The checkId, enable switch and original passive/team/opposed/empathy fields keep their original values; failure/fallback branches continue through the original route editing and publishing validation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有自动 DC、加值或结果。checkId、启用开关及原 passive/team/opposed/empathy 专属字段保持原值；失败/兜底分支继续走原路线编辑与发布校验。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "沿原正式六种专长，不改变原缺省语义。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Follows the original six official specialties; the original default semantics are unchanged."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沿原正式六种专长，不改变原缺省语义。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "沿原项目保存／同请求恢复／发布及真实新局初始化。旧局不补资源、不迁移余额；原消费、技能点、专长及TEAM写端均不改；阶段士气保底只由原STAGE_REST写端使用明确冻结值。角色页另读本人原局当前资源，检定结果展示该原请求已保存余额。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Follows the original project's save / same-request recovery / publish and real new-game initialization. Old games get no extra resources and no balance migration; original spending, skill points, specialties and TEAM writers are all unchanged; the stage morale floor is used only by the original STAGE_REST writer with an explicitly frozen value. The character page separately reads your own original game's current resources, and check results show the balance saved with that original request."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沿原项目保存／同请求恢复／发布及真实新局初始化。旧局不补资源、不迁移余额；原消费、技能点、专长及TEAM写端均不改；阶段士气保底只由原STAGE_REST写端使用明确冻结值。角色页另读本人原局当前资源，检定结果展示该原请求已保存余额。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "沿已有 RPG 角色配置编辑本主题成长曲线，不与平台经验互相换算。不会创建缺失角色模板或自动开启成长。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Edits this topic's growth curve on the existing RPG character configuration, with no conversion to or from platform experience. Missing character templates are not created and growth is not enabled automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沿已有 RPG 角色配置编辑本主题成长曲线，不与平台经验互相换算。不会创建缺失角色模板或自动开启成长。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
