          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "锁定仍计入背包负重；方案锁与交易锁不混用。不展示他队私有意向或臆造库存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "随后使用原项目保存、同请求结果恢复及发布。保存后的原项目重载显示读取基线；新共享局按发布快照提供恢复方式，旧局和已保存动作不被追改。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Then use the original project's save, same-request result recovery and publish. After saving, the reloaded original project shows the read baseline; new shared games offer recovery methods per the published snapshot, and old games and saved actions are not retroactively changed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "随后使用原项目保存、同请求结果恢复及发布。保存后的原项目重载显示读取基线；新共享局按发布快照提供恢复方式，旧局和已保存动作不被追改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "需当前真实操作实例、节点与既有高级玩法权限；过期实例不能提交。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Requires the current real operation instance, node and existing advanced-play permission; an expired instance cannot be submitted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需当前真实操作实例、节点与既有高级玩法权限；过期实例不能提交。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
