    "需要当前活动原 PLAYER 读取、回执与安全恢复配置；公共地图和工作人员权限不能代替。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Requires the current event's original PLAYER read, receipt and safe-recovery configuration; public map and staff permissions cannot substitute."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要当前活动原 PLAYER 读取、回执与安全恢复配置；公共地图和工作人员权限不能代替。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "需要真实方案票据、读取批准及安全恢复存储。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
