            "value": "Start at the old pagoda by the hutong entrance and follow the lanes to see how old Beijing courtyards meet the street."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从胡同口的古塔读起，沿公共街巷观察老北京院落与街道的关系。"
          }
        }
      }
