    "需要现存 schema2 RPG 规则；缺失、旧版或非原字符串配置保留，不用空模板替换。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This needs the project's existing RPG rules (schema 2). Missing, older or non-text settings are kept as they are and never replaced with an empty template."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
